{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45744","headline":"寄天台道友 · 贯休","name":"寄天台道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大是清虚地，高吟到日晡。\n水声金磬乱，云片玉盘粗。\n仙有遗踪在，人还得意无。\n石碑文不值，壁画色多枯。\n冷立千年鹤，闲烧六一炉。\n松枝垂似物，山势秀难图。\n紫府程非远，清溪径不迂。\n馨香柏上露，皎洁水中珠。\n贤圣无他术，圆融只在吾。\n寄言桐柏子，珍重保之乎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}